reference:
The ArrayAccess interface
ArrayAccess





  &reftitle.intro;

   Lets an object be accessed with array syntax through the offsetExists(),
   offsetGet(), offsetSet() and offsetUnset() methods.


   This page is only a summary; the full documentation is in the PHP manual:
   ArrayAccess.





